{"id":"5f40150fd41f89dc","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction.md","title":"Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions","display":"thm-shiftantichainreconstruction — Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction","aliases":["27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction"],"display":"thm-shiftantichainreconstruction — Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-ceilingsfloors]]","[[27-thm-regularleftshift]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.3 Theorem 8.15 and Equation (8.8)","source_statement":"Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions","source_printed_pages":"364","source_pdf_pages":"388","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-explicit-construction"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shiftantichainreconstruction — Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16575f999d76012f\" href=\"?note=16575f999d76012f\" title=\"27-df-ceilingsfloors\">27-df-ceilingsfloors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3151ee606f4c95e6\" href=\"?note=3151ee606f4c95e6\" title=\"27-thm-regularleftshift\">27-thm-regularleftshift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.3 Theorem 8.15 and Equation (8.8)"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f40150fd41f89dc\" href=\"?note=5f40150fd41f89dc\" title=\"Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions\">Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"364"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"388"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-explicit-construction"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a\\lhd_n b)\\Rightarrow a=b)\">\\(\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a\\lhd_n b)\\Rightarrow a=b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ceil}_n,\\mathrm{Floor}_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Ceil}_n,\\mathrm{Floor}_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16575f999d76012f\" href=\"?note=16575f999d76012f\" title=\"27-df-ceilingsfloors\">27-df-ceilingsfloors</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3151ee606f4c95e6\" href=\"?note=3151ee606f4c95e6\" title=\"27-thm-regularleftshift\">27-thm-regularleftshift</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_A^C(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\\\1&amp;\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\end{cases}\\qquad r_A^F(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\\\0&amp;\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_A^C(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\\\1&amp;\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\end{cases}\\qquad r_A^F(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\\\0&amp;\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_A^C,r_A^F\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\land\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(r_A^C)=A\\land\\mathrm{Floor}_n(r_A^F)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_A^C,r_A^F\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\land\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(r_A^C)=A\\land\\mathrm{Floor}_n(r_A^F)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^C)\\land(\\mathrm{Floor}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^F)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^C)\\land(\\mathrm{Floor}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^F)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假点沿右移向下闭合，真点沿左移向上闭合；有限偏序中每个点都受相应极值边界控制。A 反链保证重建边界没有被其他 A 元素吸收。A=∅ 时 r_A<sup>C=1、r_A</sup>F=0。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-ceilingsfloors","status":"resolved","id":"16575f999d76012f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-ceilingsfloors]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-regularleftshift","status":"resolved","id":"3151ee606f4c95e6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-regularleftshift]]","embed":false},{"target":"Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions","status":"resolved","id":"5f40150fd41f89dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-ceilingsfloors","status":"resolved","id":"16575f999d76012f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a\\lhd_n b)\\Rightarrow a=b)$；$\\mathrm{Ceil}_n,\\mathrm{Floor}_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$ 见 [[27-df-ceilingsfloors]]、[[27-thm-regularleftshift]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-regularleftshift","status":"resolved","id":"3151ee606f4c95e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a\\lhd_n b)\\Rightarrow a=b)$；$\\mathrm{Ceil}_n,\\mathrm{Floor}_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n$ 见 [[27-df-ceilingsfloors]]、[[27-thm-regularleftshift]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;((a\\lhd_n b)\\Rightarrow a=b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ceil}_n,\\mathrm{Floor}_n,\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n","display":false},{"tex":"r_A^C(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\\\1&\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(a\\lhd_n x),\\end{cases}\\qquad r_A^F(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\\\0&\\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;(x\\lhd_n a),\\end{cases}\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"r_A^C,r_A^F\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\land\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(r_A^C)=A\\land\\mathrm{Floor}_n(r_A^F)=A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{RegOrd}_n\\;\\left((\\mathrm{Ceil}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^C)\\land(\\mathrm{Floor}_n(g)=A\\Rightarrow g=r_A^F)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-shiftantichainreconstruction|thm-shiftantichainreconstruction — Left-shift antichains uniquely specify regular functions]]"}],"outgoing":["16575f999d76012f","3151ee606f4c95e6"]}